[2026-05-11T07:32:13.491Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_466","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"gh pr edit 27 --repo konard/vk-bot-desktop --body-file - <<'EOF'\nFixes #26\n\n## Summary\n\n- Add Kate Mobile token acquisition, full VK redirect URL parsing, raw token support, token auto-save notifications, and an experimental localhost callback flow.\n- Replace desktop start/stop controls with one run toggle, add background status tracking, and align the desktop mode switch and styling with the landing page.\n- Update GitHub Pages downloads with language/theme-specific app previews, grouped primary/alternate artifact buttons, UI-first checksum verification, and one-row expandable sections.\n- Preserve issue data, before screenshots, verification logs, and solution analysis in \"'`docs/case-studies/issue-26`; add a patch changeset.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nEnglish dark landing page with app preview:\n\n![English dark landing page](https://github.com/konard/vk-bot-desktop/blob/issue-26-13d5d785ff12/docs/screenshots/issue-26-pages-en-dark.png?raw=true)\n\nGrouped downloads:\n\n![Grouped downloads](https://github.com/konard/vk-bot-desktop/blob/issue-26-13d5d785ff12/docs/screenshots/issue-26-downloads-verification.png?raw=true)\n\nUI-first verification:\n\n![UI-first verification](https://github.com/konard/vk-bot-desktop/blob/issue-26-13d5d785ff12/docs/screenshots/issue-26-verification-ui.png?raw=true)\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test`\n- `deno test --allow-read`\n- `node --test tests/oauth-callback.test.js`\n- `npm run check`\n- `npm run build:renderer`\n- `npm run build:site`\n- `npm install --no-save --package-lock=false --no-audit --no-fund browser-commander@0.8.0 playwright@1.59.1`\n- `npm run test:pages:e2e -- --site-dir site/dist`\n- `node scripts/validate-changeset.mjs`\n- GitHub Actions `JavaScript CI/CD` success: https://github.com/konard/vk-bot-desktop/actions/runs/25656364254\n\n## Notes\n\nThe Pages e2e dependencies mirror the CI workflow and were installed locally with `--no-save`, so package metadata was not changed. A follow-up test-only commit keeps the localhost callback server test under Node because Deno CI intentionally runs without network permission.\nEOF'","aggregated_output":"https://github.com/konard/vk-bot-desktop/pull/27\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
